on mouseDown
  [  0] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [  2] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  4] thebuiltin 9 ............................ <the mouseH>
  [  6] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [  8] set 6 ................................... set the locH of sprite 6 to the mouseH
  [ 10] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [ 12] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 14] thebuiltin 4 ............................ <the mouseV>
  [ 16] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 18] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 6 to the mouseV
  [ 20] ret
end
